` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"829a82b48099e6c0f12047eadb27cd87","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"42076d9c0c47ecda39608f91366ce8dd","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"895145c76df425681cb82cc22ad5283e","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"9c14082e05d559390ba236bc44672fdc","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2ecfededc681f28d0ed8e61489d8c841","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"de3b6c68e16ae789a9b2f8c9516b7810","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"9b848c5d5f17cd9a7b1aa86cb86e0baa","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"21f6fcdbb90f4f840b110fa99c43a35c","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"73ac3dc51c6106f39cb7232650a7a15d","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1795018378582,"stop":1795018378685,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":"a